OL,3,GNEWSAWife tells of husband's recovery
OL,4,Afrom crash moments after buying lottery
OL,5,Aticket
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe doting father was airlifted to the
OL,8,FRoyal Preston Hospital where his family
OL,9,Fwere told he had just a 30% chance of
OL,10,Fpulling through.
OL,12,FLewis spent weeks on life support and
OL,13,Fhad more than 40 hours of surgery,
OL,14,Fincluding the amputation of his left
OL,15,Ffoot.
